 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's nice tradition. Understandable. Do you two have plan together? What does she want? The small brackets typically screw themselves in. Good plan. Hold one side together while you slip in the screws. Use a big light, stand to one side so the board tilts slightly, and have a friend hold the paper. Ask about it after the picnic. Offer to send him the picture first. Of course. Pick day and tell me, and I' move things around for you. You' done well with the waiting. Hello, as always. The message said next weekend, did it?",
